	myDescription "aurabesh = false, branch = \"\", contextComment = \"Quest Item Description localization info\", enabled = true, guid = #CC6CF61E64EE0AA800047E38F142D31A, lineVersion = 8, maxLength = 0, productId = 6, sectionId = 9307, text = \"I'm being followed, so I'm sending this in case something goes wrong. I've found the Crimson Dawn archive. It holds the identities of their agents on Kijimi, stolen Imperial blueprints, and intel on the Ashiga.\n\nOnce you've secured the files, transmit them to the Imperial channel and destroy the original. Include what countermeasures were employed by Crimson Dawn in your report.\", type = \"MenuLine\""
